@startuml
title Green Rides - State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login

state "Login" as UserLogin
UserLogin : entry / get credentials
UserLogin : do / verify login details
UserLogin : exit / login successful

UserLogin --> DestinationSelection
DestinationSelection : entry / select destination
DestinationSelection : do / display journey details
DestinationSelection : exit / show options

state "Driving Mode" as DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / activate driving mode
DrivingMode : do / enable GPS and navigation
DrivingMode : exit / ready to drive

DrivingMode --> EatOption
EatOption : entry / detect hunger
EatOption : do / display nearby restaurants
EatOption : exit / show menus

state "Restaurant Selection" as RestaurantSelection
RestaurantSelection : entry / select restaurant
RestaurantSelection : do / place order if desired
RestaurantSelection : exit / continue journey

DrivingMode --> Accident
Accident : entry / detect accident
Accident : do / inform relevant authorities
Accident : exit / send notifications

state "Feedback" as Feedback
Feedback : entry / complete journey
Feedback : do / allow users to provide feedback
Feedback : exit / save feedback

DestinationSelection --> DrivingMode
EatOption --> DrivingMode
Accident --> [*]
DrivingMode --> Feedback
Feedback --> [*]
@enduml
